      "content": "The weight of feeling like a void is profound, and it makes perfect sense why you are feeling this deep exhaustion. Please know that the value of your existence is inherent and is never dependent on how many people notice you right now. Feeling like letting go might be easier is a sign of deep pain, and reaching out for professional support can help you carry this weight. If you are in crisis, please contact a helpline immediately for compassionate, immediate support.",
